{
  "file_id": "3545",
  "text_count": 163,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Sora, are you okay?",
      "_offset": 7120,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yeah. Somehow.",
      "_offset": 7148,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I'm sorry, Koromon. You're like\nthis because of me...",
      "_offset": 7163,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Tai, nothing's gonna change if\nyou just wallow in regret.",
      "_offset": 7217,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Mimi...",
      "_offset": 7278,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "You have to perk up! For Koromon's\nsake, and for yourself!",
      "_offset": 7286,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Chosen Children...Chosen\nChildren...!",
      "_offset": 7345,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "It's Gennai!",
      "_offset": 7383,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "We got the Tags and Crests like\nyou told us to, but...",
      "_offset": 7396,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "...we couldn't get our Digimon to\nproperly evolve!",
      "_offset": 7451,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "I don't want these Crests!",
      "_offset": 7502,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Calm down, Chosen Children...",
      "_offset": 7529,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "You'll find yourselves with the\nCrests in the end, even if you\ndon't want them.",
      "_offset": 7559,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "The Tags and Crests are drawn to\neach other, you see.",
      "_offset": 7639,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "No way...",
      "_offset": 7693,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "But...for example, even with the\nCrests and Tags you've obtained...",
      "_offset": 7703,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "You'll get more things like the\nGreymon incident if you don't\nraise the Digimon properly.",
      "_offset": 7771,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Raise them properly?",
      "_offset": 7861,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yes. If you don't raise them\nproperly, you can't evolve them\ncorrectly.",
      "_offset": 7882,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "But how are we supposed to raise\nthem properly?",
      "_offset": 7954,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Chosen Children, when caring for\nyour Digimon, you should...",
      "_offset": 8002,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Gennai! Ugh, that old man's always\nsaying all these confusing things!",
      "_offset": 8063,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Raise us properly, he said.",
      "_offset": 8133,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I'm not very confident about this.",
      "_offset": 8161,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I've got no confidence, nope, none\nat all. Confidence at 0 percent.",
      "_offset": 8196,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Hey, hey!",
      "_offset": 8264,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "A warship?!",
      "_offset": 8277,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "No, it's a luxury liner!",
      "_offset": 8289,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Why is there a luxury liner in the\nmiddle of the desert?!",
      "_offset": 8314,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 8372,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Nume...",
      "_offset": 8388,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Ah! Numemon!",
      "_offset": 8396,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Ughhh. I'm hurting.",
      "_offset": 8409,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Numemon! Can you let us rest on\nyour ship? Koromon's feeling weak!",
      "_offset": 8429,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Leave the Numemon to me!",
      "_offset": 8496,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Numemoooon~! We're tired, so\nplease let us rest in this luxury\nliner, pleeeeease~!",
      "_offset": 8524,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Nu!",
      "_offset": 8607,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "P-l-e-a-s-e!",
      "_offset": 8611,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Numeeeeeeeeeeee!",
      "_offset": 8624,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa!",
      "_offset": 8641,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Heehee!",
      "_offset": 8651,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Waaaaah! It's like a five-star\nhotel!",
      "_offset": 8659,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "How nice!",
      "_offset": 8697,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I'm hungry!",
      "_offset": 8707,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "It seems there's also a dining\nroom!",
      "_offset": 8719,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Let's go check it out!",
      "_offset": 8756,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "!! It's a huge feast!",
      "_offset": 8779,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I...I wanna eat it.",
      "_offset": 8801,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "It would be wrong to just barge in\nand eat their food!",
      "_offset": 8821,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "But I *really* wanna eat it.",
      "_offset": 8876,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Me too.",
      "_offset": 8905,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Well, if we let the food get cold,\nit would be a disservice to the\nperson who made it.",
      "_offset": 8913,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 9000,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Right on, right on!",
      "_offset": 9006,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Let's eat!",
      "_offset": 9026,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Yeah!!",
      "_offset": 9037,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "W-what?!",
      "_offset": 9044,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Aaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 9053,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Nuuuuuuuu!!",
      "_offset": 9064,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Numemon! What are you doing?",
      "_offset": 9076,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Don't touch Koromon!",
      "_offset": 9105,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Taiiiiiiiii!",
      "_offset": 9126,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "A-Agumon!",
      "_offset": 9142,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Numemon! I'll be your opponent!",
      "_offset": 9152,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "All right, that's it!",
      "_offset": 9184,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Uwaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 9206,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "You're...you're Cockatrimon!",
      "_offset": 9218,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "I've got a big catch today, gya!",
      "_offset": 9247,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "While we were in the\nshowers...where'd everyone go?",
      "_offset": 9280,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "!! Who's there?",
      "_offset": 9332,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Nuuuuuuu!!",
      "_offset": 9348,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Kyaaaaaaaaah! Help, Palmon!",
      "_offset": 9359,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "It's rude to just barge in on us\nlike that! Let's go, Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 9387,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Leave it to us!",
      "_offset": 9450,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "We'll give 'em a beating!",
      "_offset": 9466,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Haaahhhh, that took way too long!",
      "_offset": 9492,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "The others might be in trouble,\ntoo. Come on, Mimi, let's go look\nfor them!",
      "_offset": 9526,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Okaaaay!",
      "_offset": 9602,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "A dining room! Someone's eaten\nhere, but...",
      "_offset": 9611,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Must have been Tai and the\nothers.",
      "_offset": 9655,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "But it doesn't look like they're\nhere anymore.",
      "_offset": 9693,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "So they were all...",
      "_offset": 9740,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "They must've been captured. Hurry,\nlet's find them!",
      "_offset": 9760,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Now that you're here anyway, it\nsaves me some time, ga-ya!",
      "_offset": 9812,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Cockatrimon?!",
      "_offset": 9871,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Is he working with Etemon?",
      "_offset": 9885,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Seems like it.",
      "_offset": 9912,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I've put the other five Chosen\nChildren out to be sun-dried,\nga-ya!",
      "_offset": 9927,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "They'll be sun-dried, ga-ya!",
      "_offset": 9995,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Aaah! He's got their Tags!",
      "_offset": 10024,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Aaah! He's got their Tags!",
      "_offset": 10051,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Just a bit and I'll have 'em\ncooked nice and dry, ga-ya!",
      "_offset": 10078,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "How horrible...",
      "_offset": 10135,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "I'll be doing the same to you,\ntoo! Cocka-ka-ka-ka-ka!",
      "_offset": 10151,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "We're gonna save everyone!",
      "_offset": 10206,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "We won't let you get away with\nthis!",
      "_offset": 10233,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 10270,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Take that!",
      "_offset": 10280,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Nngyaaaaaaaaa!",
      "_offset": 10291,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Sora! Mimi!",
      "_offset": 10306,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Tai! Everyone! I'm so glad\nyou're safe!",
      "_offset": 10318,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Yeah, the Numemon suddenly ran\naway. W-what's that?!",
      "_offset": 10361,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Aaahhh...",
      "_offset": 10414,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "It's Mimi's Crest.",
      "_offset": 10424,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Mmmmm...",
      "_offset": 10443,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Gennai said that the Tags and\nCrests are drawn to one another.",
      "_offset": 10452,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "I didn't even want this. Am I even\nable to raise Palmon properly?",
      "_offset": 10515,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "M-Mimi...",
      "_offset": 10581,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Ah, looks like we can go into this\nroom.",
      "_offset": 10591,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Let's check out the dining room\nfirst!",
      "_offset": 10632,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "...They were all really hungry,\nweren't they?",
      "_offset": 10671,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "I can't open this door, it's huge.",
      "_offset": 10717,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "It's locked, huh? Let's go find\nthe key!",
      "_offset": 10752,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "What's this? It says \"deck key\".",
      "_offset": 10793,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Maybe this opens that big door!",
      "_offset": 10826,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "Ready? I'll go in first, once we\nget the door open.",
      "_offset": 10858,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
